d of the function is $\\pi .$\n- The function is increasing in the interval $(-\\frac{\\pi }{2},0].$\n- The function has no zeros." :question/worked-solution "Let's plot the graph of $y=sec⁡x.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13934039/assets/779d7a31646a229492a8165c8212a5c83ad7d37d843c1c1b3b36766a74bc5124.png)\n\nLet's go through each statement.\n\n- Statement I is false. The period of the function is $2\\pi .$\n\n- Statement II is false. The function $y=sec⁡x$ is decreasing on $(-\\frac{\\pi }{2},0].$\n\n- Statement III is true. The function has no zeros." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-47455/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "0e2a8cf2-64db-5b2f-b0f7-0c727cf492a9"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-47455"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-103685/selection/5b26512916f768e66a2b0af106e5aa3e2ff7ee012277d9669a26d349c343f77b" :answer/id #uuid "dfc0de06-c2b0-5afe-bdd2-8f609cfcc627" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-103685/selection/1f1f2fe9df6485d5cdc7916416b2f79699d874348406e639d5daec02cb2e57e6" :answer/id #uuid "2f8f5672-e1aa-50d2-9c3d-91d2ee1de8fe" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-103685/selection/431472f1dab61ef54de031c09a96fb6a21dc69c8bc09f12797d1d686e8c9e8e6" :answer/id #uuid "ab9a74b3-f6d5-5fe1-aeb6-77136a47979b" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-103685/selection/6a87b4860f595a380edef797b2cc43b24d4896fc51da713259b980588721456c" :answer/id #uuid "46f75a7c-a905-572f-a688-1ce7ccbcbdb1" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-103685/selection/95f63c11f99a5015c1f73558576052145e00c1cfbb1718f78cf554be0ab200f9" :answer/id #uuid "768b4b31-9fff-5867-9a51-a1d11b2