\n$$\n\nTherefore, if $sec⁡x=2\\sqrt{5},$ then $sec⁡(x+20\\pi )=2\\sqrt{5}.$\n\nFinally, then\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{5}sec⁡(x+20\\pi )-3 & =\\sqrt{5}(2\\sqrt{5})-3 \\\\  & =2(5)-3 \\\\  & =10-3 \\\\  & =7.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-103706/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "ce45704e-ecea-5c67-bb40-a413f8a0d72e"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-103706"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-136625/selection/8d20a741f75dbbc695ddd00ad3a756f31b3732a55065dddd67007898b749f1ba" :answer/id #uuid "508219d1-a70e-567f-8b95-1e5129a53983" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-10+4\\pi " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-136625/selection/5d022a88a643e97abec4d01dfce48411101475c0705a98f29f3a8e3560fb0616" :answer/id #uuid "c4407f67-d36c-5988-a339-34db41d8db8f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-10" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-136625/selection/067f8394ee42d8135073fd0c196cd07b15b62bf00b668a6dd30a825b7176ad3f" :answer/id #uuid "78971341-d3d4-5d96-b015-52fb0daad5ff" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{10}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-136625/selection/5a2a736b680b68bd3c507189fbe8755ca5c4dcf810056767d8c530fee3649d22" :answer/id #uuid "975b7c9a-b929-5932-9429-30453b6845ad" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "10+4\\pi " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-136625/selection/56019ff80d11d678dbd5eca83c729f420f1b6a8ad4259032846618d6b48aa0bc" :answer/id #uuid "9b70da4e-5f59-5f9f-b941-70a3e42a6a85" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "10" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-136625/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "87c8ad36-9b51-573b-94be-52d0eb067867" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-136625/selection/5d022a88a643e97abec4d01dfce48411101475c0705a98f29f3a8e3560fb0616" :answer-field/choices ["q-136625/selection/8d20a741f75dbbc695ddd00ad3a756f31b3732a55065dddd67007898b749f1ba" "q-136625/selection/5d022a88a643e97abec4d01dfce48411101475c0705a98f29f3a8e3560fb0616" "q-136625/selection/067f8394ee42d8135073fd0c196cd07b15b62bf00b668a6dd30a825b7176ad3f" "q-136625/selection/5a2a736b680b68bd3c507189fbe8755ca5c4dcf810056767d8c530fee3649d22" "q-136625/selection/56019ff80d11d678dbd5eca83c729f420f1b6a8ad4259032846618d6b48aa0bc"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-136625" :question/id #uuid "8ab9139f-1e03-5afc-8ab4-1c973a648e4c" :question/math-academy-id "q-136625" :question/is-example false :question/problem "If $sec⁡x=-10,$ then $sec⁡(-x+4\\pi )=$" :question/worked-solution "First, let's recall the graph of $y=sec⁡x.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13934039/assets/fbf6ef1ca91f998ab4dc2dda1890ffc8a713f2eeff19e5569351b2466256d63a.png)\n\nFrom the graph, we note the following:\n\n- The period of $sec⁡x$ is $2\\pi .$\n\n- Our graph is symmetric about the $y$-axis. This means that $sec⁡x$ is an *even* function, and we have\n\n$$\nsec⁡(-x)=sec⁡x.\n$$\n\nLet's now evaluate our expression:\n\n- Firstly, using the periodicity of $sec⁡x,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}sec⁡(-x+4\\pi ) & =sec⁡(-x+2\\pi \\cdot 2) \\\\  & =sec⁡(-x).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Secondly, using the evenness of $sec⁡x,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}sec⁡(-x) & =sec⁡x \\\\  & =-10.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $sec⁡(-x+4\\pi )=-10.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-136625/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d4b378b0-30e5-59a8-b9f7-882b5e226a2e"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-136625"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-136627/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "32c81358-b525-5b89-965f-065e8f4d31cd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {